# Coverage-profile exclusions for the CI unit-coverage gate (go-pr-analysis.yml
# filters coverage.txt lines matching these patterns before computing the total).
#
# Mirrors the local Makefile coverage scope, which is the gate of record:
#   go list ./... | grep -v -E '(examples|mocks|internal/gen)'
# examples/ are runnable mains (never unit-covered) and internal/gen* is
# generated wire code exercised through the entities facades.
/examples/
/internal/gen
